OL,3,GNEWSAPerforming arts school marks 75
OL,4,Ayears in showbiz
OL,5,
OL,6,FA performing arts and dance school is
OL,7,Fmarking its 75th year with a special
OL,8,Fshow recreating some its much-loved
OL,9,Froutines from decades past.
OL,11,FYSD Theatre School in Crewe, Cheshire,
OL,12,Fwhich used to be known as the Yvonne
OL,13,FSchool of Dance, has taught generations
OL,14,Fof families, including some who have
OL,15,Fgone on to perform on the West End and
OL,16,Faround the world.
OL,18,FIt was founded by the late Yvonne
OL,19,FChesters who died a year ago, and is
OL,20,Fnow run by her sister Gail Montague.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
