OL,3,GNEWSAPerforming arts school marks 75
OL,4,Ayears in showbiz
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They key to it is, Yvonne always said
OL,7,Fshe wanted the school to be a family
OL,8,Fschool," Montague explained.
